Audio provenance and source-distribution notice

The APK's fixed lesson recordings are generated by Microsoft Edge TTS:
- Japanese: ja-JP-NanamiNeural, rate -15%.
- Chinese: zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural, rate -5%.

The public source repository distributes the project's text catalog,
manifest and generation scripts. It excludes all service-generated MP3s,
including assets/audio/ja/, assets/audio/zh/ and old assets/audio/kana/.

The root MIT license covers the project's code and documentation. It does
not grant rights over Microsoft speech-service output. This notice does not
grant a CC BY or other blanket redistribution license for those recordings.
Service use remains subject to its applicable terms:
https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/servicesagreement

Qwen3-TTS is used only for the introduction video's narration, not for the
APK's lesson audio. The upstream Qwen code and model weights retain their
Apache-2.0 license and are not bundled into the APK or this source repository.
